  "prefLabel": "Diet 403.01 Licenses Subject to Reinstatement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Diet 403.01 Licenses Subject to Reinstatement. Licenses subject to reinstatement by the OPLC under this section shall be those licenses lapsed for no more than one year.\n\nSource. #13570, eff 4-25-23; ss by #14314, eff 9-9-25, EXPIRES: 9-9-35",
